            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.27.30+LEV.27.31+LEV.27.32+LEV.27.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 27.30-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.22+DEU.14.23+DEU.14.24+DEU.14.25+DEU.14.26+DEU.14.27+DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 14.22-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bot Lulevi atyeko miyogi dul acel me apar i kom jami pa jo Icrael me bedo megi pi culo ticgi ma gitiyo, ticgi ma i kema me rwatte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok nia tin jo Icrael pe gibinyiko cok ki kema me rwatte, wek pe gunoŋ bal ma kelogi to. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Lulevi keken aye gibitiyo tic ma i kema me rwatte, gin aye gibibedo lubalo ka gin mo orocce iye. Bibedo cik matwal nio wa i kare pa likwayowu ducu; dok pe gibileyo dul lobo mo i kin jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien dul acel me apar ma a ki bot jo Icrael, ma gimiyo obed gityer bot Rwot, atyeko mi yo bot Lulevi me ginaleyagi; mumi yo aloko i komgi ni, pe gibibedo ki dul lobo mo me aleyagi i kin jo Icrael.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
